; Immersive Identification -- MCM presets.
;
; Each [section] is a preset id (listed in ii_mcm.script's `presets` field and
; named by a ui_mcm_prst_<id> string). Keys are the option STORAGE PATHS
; (ii/<page>/<option_id>, i.e. what ui_mcm.get reads); values are read by option
; type (check -> bool, track/list -> number). A preset only changes the options it
; lists; everything else keeps its current value.
;
; NOTE: a path is ii/<page>/<opt>, or ii/uistyle/<sub>/<opt> for the nested UI Style
; sub-pages (general / card / bodycam / crooks / patch). Pages: general, uistyle/general,
; uistyle/card, uistyle/simple, uistyle/bodycam, uistyle/crooks, uistyle/patch, targeting,
; hipfire, binoc, ads,
; pip, scantime, debug, colors.
; Keep in sync with the page an option lives on in ii_mcm.script (+ MCM_PAGES in
; ii_identify.script), or the preset writes a dead path and silently does nothing.

[ii_default]
;  Every option at its default value -- selecting this preset resets the mod
;  (colours reset separately via the Colors page's 'Custom colours' toggle).

